Subject: [PATCH] core: enroll fixed view-root preparation in original F

The authenticated setup launcher runs as a separate finite parent member.
It retains the ordinary sandboxing and command checks; no privileged command
flag exception is added for preparation inside a confined view service.

--- a/src/core/aos-component-parent.c
+++ b/src/core/aos-component-parent.c
@@ -58,3 +58,4 @@
         "aos-sandbox-cache-journal-view.service",
+        "aos-sandbox-view-roots.service",
         "aos-sandbox-policy-cache-recovery.service",
         "systemd-journald.service",
